<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Philips raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Philips raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Philips Electronics NV has had its rating raised to strong buy from outperform on Tuesday by Morgan Stanley, the brokerage firm said.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 38-5/8 on the New York Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
</text>
